    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David consulted with the captains of thousands and hundreds,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with every leader.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David said unto all the congregation of Israel, If",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it seem",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good unto you, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God, let us send abroad unto our brethren every where,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "left in all the land of Israel, and with them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "also",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the priests and Levites",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in their cities",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suburbs, that they may gather themselves unto us:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And let us bring again the ark of our God to us: for we enquired not at it in the days of Saul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all the congregation said that they would do so: for the thing was right in the eyes of all the people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David gathered all Israel together, from Shihor of Egypt even unto the entering of Hemath, to bring the ark of God from Kirjath-jearim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David went up, and all Israel, to Baalah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to Kirjath-jearim, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "belonged",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to Judah, to bring up thence the ark of God the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that dwelleth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "between",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the cherubims, whose name is called",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "on it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they carried the ark of God in a new cart out of the house of Abinadab: and Uzza and Ahio drave the cart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David and all Israel played before God with all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "might, and with singing, and with harps, and with psalteries, and with timbrels, and with cymbals, and with trumpets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And when they came unto the threshingfloor of Chidon, Uzza put forth his hand to hold the ark; for the oxen stumbled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the anger of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was kindled against Uzza, and he smote him, because he put his hand to the ark: and there he died before God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David was displeased, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had made a breach upon Uzza: wherefore that place is called Perez-uzza to this day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David was afraid of God that day, saying, How shall I bring the ark of God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "home",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to me?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David brought not the ark",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "home",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to himself to the city of David, but carried it aside into the house of Obed-edom the Gittite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ark of God remained with the family of Obed-edom in his house three months. And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.13.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.13.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blessed the house of Obed-edom, and all that he had.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
